{"availability":"available","full":"react-native-community/rn-diff-purge","name":"rn-diff-purge","description":"Easier React Native upgrades by clearly exposing changes from a version to another. :rocket: And what better way than to purge, init, then diff? Spoiler: there's no better way. 😎","category":"Other","language":"Shell","stars":1318,"forks":72,"created":"2019-02-21T01:25:11Z","updated":"2026-10-06T22:46:00Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"https://react-native-community.github.io/upgrade-helper","topics":["purge","react-native","rn-diff","rn-diff-purge","upgrade","upgrade-helper"],"demo":"https://react-native-community.github.io/upgrade-helper","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T22:54:50.369Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T22:54:50.369Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T22:54:50.369Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T22:54:50.369Z","stars":1318,"forks":72}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["This repository exposes an untouched React Native app generated with the CLI npx @react-native-community/cli init RnDiffApp. Each new React Native release causes a new project to be created, removing the old one, and getting a diff between them. This way, the diff is always clean, always in sync with the changes of the init template.","A dedicated branch per release makes changes very easy to watch. For example:","For some more info about the benefits of this repo's way versus the default way and rn-diff's way, read some of the conversation around here."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/react-native-community/rn-diff-purge/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"79d0c8744939842a17b166674f679ec9c03772b0cb4e8432dcdd2a74213fdc78","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T22:54:50.478Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T22:54:50.478Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"This repository exposes an untouched React Native app generated with the CLI npx @react-native-community/cli init RnDif